# #230: run by a script that kill -9s tools/ingame-test.sh once the game has started, lets the game quit, and runs it
# again. Test mode and the trip back to the editor write Autosaves and Backups and the run saves the mod's config, so
# the killed run leaves all three changed for the next run to put back.
open-window
new-script Lights
set-text
power_display(1 & 1)
end
compile
expect-result Placed 3 blocks
place-start
test-mode
wait 2
back-to-editor
expect-blocks 3
screenshot back-in-editor
